#### **Major Continents of the Earth**

There are **7 continents**:

| No. | Continent          |
| --- | ------------------ |
| 1   | **Asia**        |
| 7   | **Australia** |
| 2   | **Africa**      |
| 5   | **Antarctica**  |
| 6   | **Europe**         |
| 3   | **North America**  |
| 4   | **South America**  |
:::

:::.col-12 .col-lg-6
#### **Major Oceans of the Earth**

There are **5 oceans**:

| No. | Ocean              |
| --- | ------------------ |
| 1   | **Pacific Ocean**  |
| 2   | **Atlantic Ocean** |
| 3   | **Indian Ocean**   |
| 4   | **Southern Ocean** |
| 5   | **Arctic Ocean**   |
:::
